---
manual: element.link.click_proc
lines: [2034, 2034]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: F9
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $clicks = 0
  @p = para link("there", click: proc { $clicks += 1 })
end
----------- test code
assert_equal 0, $clicks

click_on para("@p")

assert_equal 1, $clicks, "clicking the link runs its click: proc"
